Note on the legacy dataset: the curated list at `README-LEGACY.md` is adapted
from the public-domain collection at
https://github.com/tortuvshin/open-source-flutter-apps (CC0 1.0 Universal).
The list itself is a small set of GitHub URLs, project names, and one-line
descriptions — facts, not creative expression — and is intended to remain
freely reusable. If you want to use the legacy list under CC0 terms, see
`README-LEGACY.md` for the original provenance and the CC0 deed at
